    <string name="timing_help">Time since the last qualifying unlock, including sleep. Screen wakes do not reset it. Snooze affects both timers; Skip affects only the scheduled rule. Full reboot returns the device to BFU and removes temporary root.</string>
    <string name="failures_help">Counts actual attempts from the selected source. Device admin covers credential failures in its user/profile. Biometric failures require the System UI hook. Thresholds bypass schedule and snooze.</string>
    <string name="panic_help">Enable Repose in Vector/LSPosed for System UI. Use a separate panic PIN or password matching your lock-screen input type. A match keeps the device locked and starts the reboot flow. Blank secret fields keep the saved value.</string>
    <string name="remote_help">A plain passphrase is reusable and can be replayed by anyone who sees it. Signed commands are device-bound, expiring and one-use. Both modes match input exactly. The HTTPS inbox is a separate command adapter, not the LastSignal keepalive endpoint.</string>
